      "creatureEntry": 12419,
      "descriptionStatus": "OFFICIAL_ZHCN_BATTLE_PET_SPECIES",
      "descriptionZhCN": "天赋异禀的工程师们制造出了林蛙的精密复制体——成本仅相当于真品价格的十倍。",
      "sourceBuild": "7.3.5.26972",
      "sourceRowId": 95,
      "spellId": 19772
    },
    {
      "collectionId": 100358,
      "creatureEntry": 14421,
      "descriptionStatus": "OFFICIAL_ZHCN_BATTLE_PET_SPECIES",
      "descriptionZhCN": "一个相当复杂的地道系统保护了土拨鼠免遭邻居的大蹄子踩踏。",
      "sourceBuild": "7.3.5.26972",
      "sourceRowId": 70,
      "spellId": 10709
    },
    {
      "collectionId": 100364,
      "creatureEntry": 14755,
      "descriptionStatus": "OFFICIAL_ZHCN_BATTLE_PET_SPECIES",
      "descriptionZhCN": "相传，这些充满活力的翡翠同伴能给主人带来好运，保他们旅途平安。",
      "sourceBuild": "7.3.5.26972",
      "sourceRowId": 757,
      "spellId": 23531
    },
    {
      "collectionId": 100365,
      "creatureEntry": 14756,
      "descriptionStatus": "OFFICIAL_ZHCN_BATTLE_PET_SPECIES",
      "descriptionZhCN": "据说如果能在秋天见到，就能交上好运。一向对不熟悉的生物退避三舍。",
      "sourceBuild": "7.3.5.26972",
      "sourceRowId": 758,
      "spellId": 23530
    },
    {
      "collectionId": 100366,
      "creatureEntry": 14878,
      "descriptionStatus": "OFFICIAL_ZHCN_BATTLE_PET_SPECIES",
      "descriptionZhCN": "许多人认为传说中的醉蛙已经灭绝了，直到暗月马戏团的怪味酒把它们都吸引了出来。",
      "sourceBuild": "7.3.5.26972",
      "sourceRowId": 106,
      "spellId": 23811
    },
    {
      "collectionId": 100367,
      "creatureEntry": 15186,
      "descriptionStatus": "OFFICIAL_ZHCN_BATTLE_PET_SPECIES",
      "descriptionZhCN": "这只可爱又隐居避世的鱼人，其外表一定能吸引大批围观者。",
      "sourceBuild": "7.3.5.26972",
      "sourceRowId": 107,
      "spellId": 24696
    },
    {
      "collectionId": 100370,
      "creatureEntry": 15358,
      "descriptionStatus": "OFFICIAL_ZHCN_BATTLE_PET_SPECIES",
      "descriptionZhCN": "乐奇那可爱迷人的气质和活泼搞怪的动作，必然能舒缓沮丧，令最晦暗的心情焕发光亮。",
      "sourceBuild": "7.3.5.26972",
      "sourceRowId": 111,
      "spellId": 24988
    },
    {
      "collectionId": 100373,
      "creatureEntry": 15361,
      "descriptionStatus": "OFFICIAL_ZHCN_BATTLE_PET_SPECIES",
      "descriptionZhCN": "霸波尔奔是全世界最稀有的鱼人品种之一。",
      "sourceBuild": "7.3.5.26972",
      "sourceRowId": 1168,
      "spellId": 25018
    },
    {
      "collectionId": 100292,
      "creatureEntry": 15429,
      "descriptionStatus": "OFFICIAL_ZHCN_BATTLE_PET_SPECIES",
      "descriptionZhCN": "警告：请在接触恶心的软泥怪时佩戴手套和护目镜。请勿水洗。可污染大部分护甲。",
      "sourceBuild": "7.3.5.26972",
      "sourceRowId": 114,
      "spellId": 25162
    },
    {
      "collectionId": 100375,
      "creatureEntry": 15698,
      "descriptionStatus": "OFFICIAL_ZHCN_BATTLE_PET_SPECIES",
      "descriptionZhCN": "这些小家伙不知疲倦地在为冬幕节做精心准备，并且在接下来的日子中如果能不被打扰，他们就很感激了。",
      "sourceBuild": "7.3.5.26972",
      "sourceRowId": 119,
      "spellId": 26533
    },
    {
      "collectionId": 100376,
      "creatureEntry": 15699,
      "descriptionStatus": "OFFICIAL_ZHCN_BATTLE_PET_SPECIES",
      "descriptionZhCN": "在这个聪明小玩意的内部装有秘密开关，可禁用‘安静’模式。所幸就连制作它的工程师都不知道这个开关在哪儿。",
      "sourceBuild": "7.3.5.26972",
      "sourceRowId": 116,
      "spellId": 26010
    },
    {
      "collectionId": 100377,
      "creatureEntry": 15705,
      "descriptionStatus": "OFFICIAL_ZHCN_BATTLE_PET_SPECIES",
      "descriptionZhCN": "在宏大的冬幕节庆典期间，这些忠实的小伙伴将快乐传播至整个大陆。在接下来的日子里，她们可有的忙了。",
      "sourceBuild": "7.3.5.26972",
      "sourceRowId": 120,
      "spellId": 26541
    },
    {
      "collectionId": 100378,
      "creatureEntry": 15706,
      "descriptionStatus": "OFFICIAL_ZHCN_BATTLE_PET_SPECIES",
      "descriptionZhCN": "等不及要打开包装精美的节日礼盒了。",
      "sourceBuild": "7.3.5.26972",
      "sourceRowId": 118,
      "spellId": 26529
    },
    {
      "collectionId": 100379,
      "creatureEntry": 15710,
      "descriptionStatus": "OFFICIAL_ZHCN_BATTLE_PET_SPECIES",
      "descriptionZhCN": "他很爱和你跳舞，和你摇摆，和你嬉戏！他会在冬幕节之后融化。别担心，他还会再回来的！",
      "sourceBuild": "7.3.5.26972",
      "sourceRowId": 117,
      "spellId": 26045
    },
